## Default of Credit Card Clients

- Creator: I-Cheng Yeh.
- Citation: Yeh, I. (2009). Default of Credit Card Clients [Dataset].
  UCI Machine Learning Repository. https://doi.org/10.24432/C55S3H
- Source: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/350/default+of+credit+card+clients
- License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).
- License link: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Project transformations include renaming fields, decoding and grouping
categories, reshaping monthly columns into client-month records, and
calculating aggregated indicators. These transformations do not change the
original source attribution or the applicable data license.

Avenor Bank is a fictional name used for the educational scenario. The source
dataset does not originate from a real organization of that name. No
endorsement by the dataset creator or UCI is implied.
